<title>SWEDEN: ATHLETICS-HIGH JUMPER SJOBERG OUT OF WORLD CHAMPIONSHIPS.</title>
<headline>ATHLETICS-HIGH JUMPER SJOBERG OUT OF WORLD CHAMPIONSHIPS.</headline>
<text>
<p>STOCKHOLM, July 29, Reuter - Former high jump world record</p>
<p>holder Patrik Sjoberg of Sweden will miss the world athletics</p>
<p>championships starting in Athens on Friday because he has not</p>
<p>recovered from a knee injury.</p>
<p>&quot;I will concentrate on getting fit for the events coming up</p>
<p>after the championships and my first event will be in Ebertstadt</p>
<p>(Germany) on August 17,&quot; he said on Tuesday.</p>
</text>
